From: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pwrseq: qcom-wcn: WCN7860 vendor supply roles for iceland

Ours (2026-11-01, C3 radios): the supply-role list the pwrseq-qcom-wcn driver
expects for the WCN7860 as wired on the OnePlus Pad 4, taken from the stock
device tree's regulator roles. Exit: submit to Perpetua with 0003/0005.

Signed-off-by: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/power/sequencing/pwrseq-qcom-wcn.c b/drivers/power/sequencing/pwrseq-qcom-wcn.c
index 97692c4de340..b3f06aacc604 100644
--- a/drivers/power/sequencing/pwrseq-qcom-wcn.c
+++ b/drivers/power/sequencing/pwrseq-qcom-wcn.c
@@ -402,12 +402,13 @@ static const struct pwrseq_qcom_wcn_pdata pwrseq_wcn7850_of_data = {
 };
 
 static const char *const pwrseq_wcn7860_vregs[] = {
-	"vddio",
 	"vddio1p2",
+	"vddant",
 	"vddaon",
 	"vdddig",
-	"vddrfa1p2",
 	"vddrfa1p8",
+	"vddrfa1p2",
+	"vddcx",
 };
 
 static const struct pwrseq_qcom_wcn_pdata pwrseq_wcn7860_of_data = {
